> h8(x: real in 0..10) = sum(i, 0, 7, floor(x + real(i)/8))
> closed h8
sum(i, 0, 7, floor(x + real(i)/8))
  = floor(8x)
  method: Hermite's identity (floors over one period)
  check: equals direct iteration at all 201 points of the domain
> h16(x: real in -3..3) = sum(i, 5, 20, floor(x + real(i)/16))
> closed h16
sum(i, 5, 20, floor(x + real(i)/16))
  = floor(16x + 5)
  method: Hermite's identity (floors over one period)
  check: equals direct iteration at all 201 points of the domain
> hh(x: real in 0..1) = sum(i, 0, 255, floor(255x + real((i*37 + 11) & 255)/256))
> closed hh
sum(i, 0, 255, floor(255x + real(37i + 11 & 0xff)/256))
  = floor(65280x)
  method: Hermite's identity (floors over one period)
  check: equals direct iteration at all 201 points of the domain
> hx(x: real in 0..1) = sum(i, 0, 15, floor(16x + 0.0625*real(i xor 5)))
> closed hx
sum(i, 0, 15, floor(16x + 0.0625real(i xor 5)))
  = floor(256x)
  method: Hermite's identity (floors over one period)
  check: equals direct iteration at all 201 points of the domain
> show hh(0.123)
_() = 8029
  -> real
> rn(x: real in 0..1) = sum(i, 0, 255, floor(255x + 0.5))
> closed rn
sum(i, 0, 255, floor(255x + 0.5))
  = 256floor(255x + 0.5)
  method: constant body
  check: equals direct iteration at all 201 points of the domain
